         "text": [
            {
                "text": "#### Historical Equality\n\nComparing isn't just about math. We do it all the time — to make decisions or to understand the past.\n\nLet's look at one example and learn how to compare historical evidence.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
