         "audio": "",
         "smile": "inlove",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "dd4f3c8a-6624-4df5-93ac-37e0a4be9fdc",
               "text": "Mapswire",
               "page": "https://mapswire.com",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "ffffd208-eb09-4da3-b516-f8bc695758dd",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=ffffd208-eb09-4da3-b516-f8bc695758dd",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
                "text": "#### Mapping\n\nThere is a region that today covers several countries. In the past, its borders were different, but the culture was the same.\n\nIt is called Mesoamerica. See the map:",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><img id=\"imgGeo14\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgGeo14', '0%')\" src=\"\" class=\"imgcenter\"/><b>Figure 1</b>: In this map, the continent is highlighted © Mapswire (<htcite0>)</p>",
